      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Arak Bali is a traditional and legendary alcoholic beverage native to the
    Island of the Gods. It is meticulously distilled across generations using the
    fermented sap of coconut palms, lontar palms, or red rice. The drink features
    a distinct, robust aroma that instantly warms the body and has deeply rooted
    cultural significance, serving as an essential element in traditional Balinese
    rituals, ceremonies, and communal gatherings. In contemporary times, skilled
    mixologists also utilize arak as a unique foundation for modern cocktails that
    highlight authentic local flavors.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 48a8c59fe7748cc4fa84177fbb4956a1, type: 2}
